  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GRAISEA II (Cambodia Apr-Jul 2023)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender Transformative and Responsible Agribusiness Investment in South East Asia (GRAISEA) aims to demonstrate that business in the agricultural sector in South East (SE) Asia, can be a driver of human rights, women&apos;s economic empowerment and climate resilience. Working in the Philippines, Indonesia, Cambodia, Vietnam and Pakistan, GRAISEA 2 aims to be a catalyst, bringing about systemic change in how business operates through influencing at four levels.</narrative>
  </description>
